        "name": "MockUpdatableHookV2",
        "desc": "The same hook with a trivially different program (one extra read-only method), so updating a\nMockUpdatableHook to it bumps Application.version while the hook keeps working. The pinning test\nuses it to show that only rejectVersion stops a pool pinned to the earlier version.",
